{"title":"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A line has equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5d67737ab1b95637806f4b489530b56e11b9a5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2x - 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />. What is its <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercept and what is its <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercept?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercept of the equation is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a06334068417b1781d14e8b28af827907961eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercept of the equation is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a06334068417b1781d14e8b28af827907961eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/9/ed9a56ab438fc767827c0242c8f495b37b4080ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = 2x_{\\text{int}} - 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/5/f85b20ec445aaa3e298b4184f56a05a76fe7b354.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x_{\\text{int}} = 0 + 6 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/c/f3cc6f4bddf8b1aacf3e612715ff9c5e2a9b7627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{\\text{int}} = \\frac{6}{2} = \\boxed{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"111\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Next, from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/536a3bcee68d746371a8631e091ea01c6dc19835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = mx + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" />, we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> (the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercept) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/e/4be006c22a04ed9e687afbe6481a9297c9541ef1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{-6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"35\" height=\"24\" /> in the equation.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018005316\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 67/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 77/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3037/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.044      1 2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3\n100.00%    6.044      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35565:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018005316 and revision id 277970. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}